ACORN 1.0 IWML 1.0
JSON_Local.Index
  Styles[]
    CSS
      Text:
        html, body {
          background-color: lightblue;
        }
        .UserContainer {
          background-color: white;
          color: gray;
          font-weight: bold;
          padding: 15px;
        }
        .Username {
          font-size: 14px;
        }
        .NameContainer {
          font-size: 30px;
          color: #222;
        }

  Data[]
    Data:Persons persons.json
      KeyName: username #If there is no id field, specify another unique field

  SimpleStack
    DataSource: Persons
      SimpleStack
        StyleClass: UserContainer
        Text =*.username
          StyleClass: Username
        Div
          StyleClass: NameContainer
          Text =*.firstName
          space
          Text =*.lastName
        Text =*.gender
        Text =*.aboutAuthor
      gap
